  waitingEvents:
  - eventName: Sliding on Chair
    situationPrompt: Anu spots the fish tank and starts sliding off her chair! Which
      behavior is polite and safe?
    correctPoseSprite: {fileID: 941041183, guid: 2b41ed0d35da7a34d91e867a39e7b71c, type: 3}
    incorrectPoseSprite: {fileID: -830577679, guid: 2b41ed0d35da7a34d91e867a39e7b71c, type: 3}
    tableVisualOnFail: {fileID: -1308390870, guid: ac77abff6ceca544fac6af7927297037, type: 3}
    successFeedback: Good job! Sitting straight keeps you safe in your chair.
    failFeedback: Sliding off can cause a fall! Try again.
    sfxOnFail: SFX_ChairWobble
    sfxOnSuccess: SFX_Sparkle
  - eventName: Hitting Glass with Spoon
    situationPrompt: Anu wants to make noise with her spoon while waiting. What should
      she do?
    correctPoseSprite: {fileID: 291849145, guid: 2a89bae96a055de428a5532ae0d924ea, type: 3}
    incorrectPoseSprite: {fileID: 202234102, guid: 2a89bae96a055de428a5532ae0d924ea, type: 3}
    tableVisualOnFail: {fileID: 1585037361, guid: ac77abff6ceca544fac6af7927297037, type: 3}
    successFeedback: Nice! Keeping cutlery quiet is polite to other diners.
    failFeedback: Ting ting ting! Tapping glass is loud and disturbing. Try again.
    sfxOnFail: SFX_GlassTing
    sfxOnSuccess: SFX_Sparkle
  - eventName: Waiting for Food
    situationPrompt: The food is taking a while to arrive and Anu is hungry. How
      should she wait?
    correctPoseSprite: {fileID: 1407503196, guid: 2a89bae96a055de428a5532ae0d924ea, type: 3}
    incorrectPoseSprite: {fileID: -195794794, guid: 2a89bae96a055de428a5532ae0d924ea, type: 3}
    tableVisualOnFail: {fileID: 105546710, guid: ac77abff6ceca544fac6af7927297037, type: 3}
    successFeedback: Great patience! Food is being prepared fresh.
    failFeedback: Shouting or banging cutlery disturbs the restaurant! Try again.
    sfxOnFail: VO_U6_ANU_7
    sfxOnSuccess: SFX_Sparkle
  - eventName: Kneeling on Chair
    situationPrompt: Anu wants to kneel up on her chair with feet underneath. What
      should she do?
    correctPoseSprite: {fileID: 941041183, guid: 2b41ed0d35da7a34d91e867a39e7b71c, type: 3}
    incorrectPoseSprite: {fileID: 1389187380, guid: 2b41ed0d35da7a34d91e867a39e7b71c, type: 3}
    tableVisualOnFail: {fileID: -1105260315, guid: ac77abff6ceca544fac6af7927297037, type: 3}
    successFeedback: Both feet down! Sitting properly keeps the chair steady.
    failFeedback: The chair will wobble and tip over! Try again.
    sfxOnFail: SFX_ChairWobble
    sfxOnSuccess: SFX_Sparkle
